Package: txhome
Title: Explore How Texas Housing Markets Weathered the 2008 Financial Crisis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Chenuli", "Muthukuda Arachchige",
           email = "cmut0005@student.monash.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a cleaned version of monthly Texas housing market data
    from 2000 to 2015, functions to summarise how each market's sales and
    prices changed during and after the 2008 financial crisis, and an
    interactive Shiny app for comparing the resilience and recovery of
    different Texas housing markets. Data originally from the TAMU Real
    Estate Center, as distributed in the 'ggplot2' package.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
